#. Plugin Name of the plugin
msgid "WowShipping – Weight Based Flexible Table Rate Shipping for WooCommerce"
msgstr "WowShipping – Envío flexible basado en peso para WooCommerce"

#. Description of the plugin
msgid "WowShipping allows store owners to define flexible shipping rates based on conditions like weight, destination, price, item count etc."
msgstr "WowShipping permite a los propietarios de tiendas definir tarifas de envío flexibles basadas en condiciones como peso, destino, precio, cantidad de artículos, etc."

#. Author of the plugin
msgid "WPXPO"
msgstr "WPXPO"

#. Author URI of the plugin
msgid "https://www.wpxpo.com/about"
msgstr "https://www.wpxpo.com/about"

